=== propose
DISABLE_PROMPT_CACHING=1
cwd=<WORK>/root
arg: -p
arg: --model
arg: sonnet
arg: --system-prompt
arg: You improve the prompt of one AgentSI agent from the traces of its past meetings.
Read the traces: the agent's answers, the check failures, the sources that did not resolve, the invented sources and the marks of Ada. Find the one cause behind the repeated failure and change the instructions to remove it.
Change one thing. Keep the role's voice, its language and every rule that is not the cause.
The check is a floor, not a goal. Never weaken a rule about sources or about writing "[no data]" when data is missing. Never tell the agent to cite a file it did not read, or a doc only to pass a check.
Return in `new_overlay_body` the complete new body of the product overlay: the text appended to the global role under "## This product". At most 4000 characters.
You may start it with a frontmatter block that changes only model or effort.
`rationale`: the cause you found, citing minutes ids. `expected_effect`: which replay metric should improve (first-pass check, unresolved sources, invented sources, missing objectives) and why. Write both in Spanish: Ada reads them before approving.
arg: --no-session-persistence
arg: --safe-mode
arg: --restricted
arg: --strict-mcp-config
arg: --disable-slash-commands
arg: --permission-mode
arg: dontAsk
arg: --permission-prompts
arg: none
arg: --max-budget-usd
arg: 0.4
arg: --tools=
arg: --effort
arg: high
arg: --json-schema
arg: {"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["new_overlay_body","rationale","expected_effect"],"properties":{"new_overlay_body":{"type":"string"},"rationale":{"type":"string"},"expected_effect":{"type":"string"}}}
